<title>NETHERLANDS: SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates down at end-Aug.</title>
<headline>SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates down at end-Aug.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS Warehouse Services gave the following estimates of cooca beans in store in Europe as of the end of August/early September. All figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>			 Total     Of which for the buffer stock</p>
<p> AMSTERDAM	  471,500	  43,973.251</p>
<p> HAMBURG/BREMEN   112,300	  15,693.302</p>
<p> UK (ALL PORTS)    48,250	   4,083.467</p>
<p> ANTWERP	     61,250	   6,230.735</p>
<p> ROTTERDAM	   14,750	  10,763.861</p>
<p>The data gives the following changes to month-ago totals  AMSTERDAM	 DOWN 26,000</p>
<p> HAMBURG/BREMEN  DOWN  6,200</p>
<p> UK (ALL PORTS)  DOWN  2,750</p>
<p> ANTWERP	   DOWN  3,250</p>
<p> ROTTERDAM	 DOWN    750</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
